      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should add a check that prevents CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP from getting set to TYPEC_RP_3A0.  Otherwise this path could overload the board.  Probably should be a standalone CL.\n\nOnly servos set to this something other than TYPEC_RP_1A5.",
