      "message": "I think generating a build error if (CONFIG_USB_PD_3A_PORTS \u003e 0) \u0026\u0026 (CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP \u003d\u003d TYPEC_RP_3A0) is a good path.  With comments as to why CONFIG_USB_PD_PULLUP can disable DPM source-out policy.",
